{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-39","kind":"proposition","title":"等面积同底三角形位于同一组平行线之间","englishTitle":"Equal triangles which are on the same base and on the same side are also in the same parallels.","book":1,"number":39,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.39","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.39/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":39,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","contentId":"euclid-1-39","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9bfd364552e815611bafa401aea85bc08f37ab880d91609cd42b858853131734","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-39.statement","euclid-1-39.construction.1","euclid-1-39.proof.1","euclid-1-39.proof.2","euclid-1-39.proof.3","euclid-1-39.proof.4","euclid-1-39.proof.5","euclid-1-39.proof.6","euclid-1-39.proof.7","euclid-1-39.conclusion","euclid-1-39.historical.1","euclid-1-39.historical.2","euclid-1-39.historical.3","euclid-1-39.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-39.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-39","revisionId":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6353d39c2f1e0e985780a877eb3de93f38e43d6aff370f5bdeb0a9073795eeab","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Equal triangles which are on the same base and on the same side are also in the same parallels."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同一面底边和同一面的等式三角形也处于相同平行状态。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形其底同其形等必在两平行线内"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个三角形的底必须与两条平行线的形状相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-39.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-39","revisionId":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"345fa936bc334c8b85620b60189ffd5dc9ed76688e59746f666c639b99c65914","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DBC be equal triangles which are on the same base BC and on the same side of it; [I say that they are also in the same parallels.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC,DBC等量三角形,在相同的底边,BC和同一侧;[我说,它们也处于相同的平行。 ]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-39.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-39","revisionId":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7917c0fae5cb423a9b4b25c230b344342a33405ae3095d871b2f54985f0cac8f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And [For] let AD be joined; I say that AD is parallel to BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AD连接其中,我说AD与BC平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-39.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-39","revisionId":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89fb33479f911e23eedc73aa9fdf0a97188271c3dbc760c481c7bf566c3e624c","citations":["euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, let AE be drawn through the point A parallel to the straight line BC, [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)] and let EC be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果不是,则通过A点与BC线平行,AE点与EC点连接。 [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-39.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-39","revisionId":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"45df9142e3db8d81074edec9ccfaa2f7ea240498817cdad67880f24312534667","citations":["euclid-1-37"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle ABC is equal to the triangle EBC; for it is on the same base BC with it and in the same parallels. [[I. 37](/principles/euclid-1-37)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角形ABC等于三角形EBC;因为它与三角形底边 BC相同,并处于相同的平行状态。 [[I. 37](/principles/euclid-1-37)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-39.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-39","revisionId":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bd62b0444c1a45f17b569631d499644d23b80501e433da0305e7394f4273004a","citations":["euclid-1-cn-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But ABC is equal to DBC; therefore DBC is also equal to EBC, [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)] the greater to the less: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ABC等于DBC,因此DBC也等于EBC,数量大于数量:这是不可能的。 [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-39.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-39","revisionId":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2cdde6d7b8db81828b17af7bf6cd616a1d315a0c0cb47bb20158359d7941c98c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AE is not parallel to BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AE项与BC项不平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-39.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-39","revisionId":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"05d770c5757679e9f4d9fe5d5ab498e94a34fdab3e996ac7f4f7ae75a93bc634","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither is any other straight line except AD; therefore AD is parallel to BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,除AD外,没有其他任何一条直线;因此,AD直线与BC平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-39.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-39","revisionId":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-39.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-39","revisionId":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-39.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-39","revisionId":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ad0b972d368acbd92192296c11ff791503da5e98e327f936e42bd440a61402d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形其底同其形等必在两平行线内"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个三角形的底必须与两条平行线的形状相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-39.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-39","revisionId":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eea51b9b6ee5c87198b083e0b740a7ff0f9b6be2ab6289c3fa88f0ea79373264","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙与丁丙乙两角形之乙丙底同其形复等题言在两平行线内者盖云自甲至丁作直线必与乙丙平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙 和 丁丙乙，三角形 乙丙 的底相同，并且它们的形状复杂。命题：对于位于两条平行线之间的图形，据说从 甲 到 丁 的直线必须与 乙丙 平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-39.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-39","revisionId":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"158206a3c9b746c5f96444493d437b755eba1d9c449994150681ba213c9950d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：如云不然令从甲别作直线与乙丙平行〈本篇卅一〉必在甲丁之上或在其下矣设在上为甲戊而乙丁线引出至戊即作戊丙直线是甲乙丙宜与戊丙乙两角形等矣〈本篇卅七〉夫甲乙丙与丁丙乙既等而与戊丙乙复等是全与其分等也〈公论〉〈九〉设在甲丁下为甲己即作己丙直线是己丙乙与丁丙乙亦等如前驳之"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：如果不是，如果我们从 甲 绘制一条平行于 乙丙 的独立直线，〈本篇卅一〉 必须位于 甲丁 上方或下方。设上方为 甲戊，延伸到 戊 的 乙丁 直线是 戊丙，即 戊丙。直线 甲乙丙 应该等于两个三角形 戊丙乙。〈本篇卅七〉：由于 甲乙丙 和 丁丙乙 相等，但也等于 戊丙乙 〈公论〉〈九〉，这正好等于 戊丙乙。设 甲丁 在 甲己 下方，则写 己丙，而直线 己丙乙 和 丁丙乙 应该与之前相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-39.source","contentId":"euclid-1-39","revisionId":"euclid-1-39@raw-9bfd364552e81561","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1ced3f8dc5d1a7c672c143d810ea91f977f2cd14eda3de3519a28090f653d95","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.39/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.39\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-39:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-39","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-39.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.39","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.39/","sourceLabel":"I. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-39:euclid-1-37:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-39","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-39.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-37","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.39","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.39/","sourceLabel":"I. 37"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-39:euclid-1-cn-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-39","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-39.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-cn-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.39","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.39/","sourceLabel":"C.N. 1"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-2:euclid-1-39:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-2.proof.12"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-39","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"I. 39"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-39:euclid-1-31:explicit","id":"euclid-1-31","book":1,"number":31,"kind":"proposition","title":"过已知点作已知直线的平行线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-39:euclid-1-37:explicit","id":"euclid-1-37","book":1,"number":37,"kind":"proposition","title":"同底同高三角形面积相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-39:euclid-1-cn-1:explicit","id":"euclid-1-cn-1","book":1,"number":1,"kind":"common-notion","title":"公理一：等于同一事物的事物彼此相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-6-2:euclid-1-39:explicit","id":"euclid-6-2","book":6,"number":2,"kind":"proposition","title":"平行截线定理及其逆命题","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-parallel","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
